  "rigidity_scan_a_mu_coefficient": {
    "definition": "Replace the '24' multiplying the Appell-Lerch mu-term by N in 20..28; STRUCTURAL selector: the two independent y-power slices (j=0,j=2) of H(N) must agree (z-independence). No literal target used in the selecting condition itself.",
    "scan": [
